1
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,400
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:27,800
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:30,680
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:35,400
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,080
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,760
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:48,440
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:55,760
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:58,600
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,520
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:04,120
=Episode 20=

12
00:01:04,439 --> 00:01:07,000
So bring out the best side
of your nature

13
00:01:07,239 --> 00:01:08,840
for this meeting.

14
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:11,239
Let him feel how much you love him.

15
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:13,480
Your Highness, take your time.

16
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:15,480
I'll leave you two to it.

17
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:18,719
Feng Weiyue,

18
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,920
Yuan Qing is trouble.

19
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:22,519
You need to stay away from him.

20
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,200
Hmm.

21
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:29,680
Your Highness, please take a seat.

22
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:40,519
Your Highness,

23
00:01:42,239 --> 00:01:43,480
please have some tea.

24
00:01:57,359 --> 00:01:58,840
Your Highness, you must be tired
after all your work.

25
00:01:59,599 --> 00:02:02,519
As your servant, let me
rub your shoulders.

26
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,479
Feng Weiyue,

27
00:02:10,479 --> 00:02:12,199
what are you up to now?

28
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,759
Can you just talk normally?

29
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:20,120
Have I upset Your Highness again?

30
00:02:23,919 --> 00:02:24,800
Weiyue,

31
00:02:25,919 --> 00:02:28,719
the second wedding was never completed,

32
00:02:29,159 --> 00:02:31,680
but we've long been husband and wife
in truth

33
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,759
and in heart.

34
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:37,319
Whether now or ever,

35
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,680
you never need to wait on me,

36
00:02:40,759 --> 00:02:43,479
and never call yourself my servant.

37
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,000
Mo Yuya...

38
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,840
I love you.

39
00:03:40,919 --> 00:03:41,800
(What happened?)

40
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,919
(Did we sleep together again
last night?)

41
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:00,080
Mo Yuya!

42
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:00,719
You jerk!

43
00:04:01,159 --> 00:04:01,719
What now?

44
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:04,479
Look what you did.
So you bite like a dog?

45
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:07,159
Yesterday, you used your strength
to go beat up your rival,

46
00:04:07,159 --> 00:04:08,520
then you sneaked in at midnight
and started nibbling on me?

47
00:04:11,879 --> 00:04:12,520
Feng Weiyue,

48
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,840
think carefully.

49
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:17,079
Which one of us started it last night?

50
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:23,879
(I love you.)

51
00:04:27,439 --> 00:04:28,240
Darn that geezer.

52
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:34,680
Feng Weiyue,

53
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,639
what are you doing?

54
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:38,240
Fine, I was the one who started it
last night,

55
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:40,639
but if you hadn't come to my room,

56
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,240
none of this would have happened.

57
00:04:42,399 --> 00:04:44,000
When you went to fight your rival
yesterday,

58
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,199
you couldn't win
and couldn't take the loss,

59
00:04:45,199 --> 00:04:46,120
so you came to me

60
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:47,439
and forced yourself on me!

61
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:49,360
That shows you don't trust
our relationship,

62
00:04:49,839 --> 00:04:52,800
that you don't fully trust me.

63
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,279
Jerk!

64
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,160
Heh.

65
00:04:56,639 --> 00:04:57,600
What did you say?

66
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,759
I couldn't beat that man?

67
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:00,879
That's because...

68
00:05:04,199 --> 00:05:04,920
Stop right there!

69
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,360
I couldn't beat him?

70
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:14,720
My martial arts are unmatched
in the world.

71
00:05:15,399 --> 00:05:16,040
That's because...

72
00:05:17,839 --> 00:05:19,759
Because I was poisoned.

73
00:05:20,519 --> 00:05:21,920
Nothing I say gets through to you.

74
00:05:23,439 --> 00:05:24,319
Straighten this arm.

75
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:25,680
Straight.

76
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,360
This one too.

77
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,160
A little straighter.

78
00:05:37,319 --> 00:05:37,959
Ye.

79
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:39,480
Oh,

80
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,480
hey.

81
00:05:40,519 --> 00:05:41,720
Hey.

82
00:05:42,079 --> 00:05:42,839
Your Highness,

83
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,160
what can I do for you?

84
00:05:44,839 --> 00:05:45,839
Spar with me.

85
00:05:51,879 --> 00:05:53,560
Ye, you nearly killed me!

86
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:55,040
He...

87
00:05:55,279 --> 00:05:56,240
Mo Yuya, you...

88
00:05:57,279 --> 00:05:57,920
Ignore him.

89
00:05:58,079 --> 00:05:58,920
Let's keep training.

90
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,439
Mo Yuya, you...

91
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,399
You...

92
00:06:37,199 --> 00:06:39,120
If your hairpin hadn't gone
flying at her,

93
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,040
would I have needed to save her?

94
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,600
Feng Weiyue,

95
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:45,120
there's a limit to jealousy.

96
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:48,839
Wait, I really wasn't aiming at her.

97
00:06:48,879 --> 00:06:51,199
Enough. Be angry with me if you must,

98
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,680
but don't hurt the innocent.

99
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,199
I...

100
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,000
Hey,

101
00:06:58,279 --> 00:06:58,800
I...

102
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,560
Forgive me, Your Highness.

103
00:07:03,319 --> 00:07:05,879
My feet won't move.

104
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:09,680
My junior sister can't walk now either.

105
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:12,480
Please take her back to her room,
Your Highness.

106
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,279
Hey.

107
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,480
You two...

108
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,120
Mo... Mo Yuya!

109
00:07:28,839 --> 00:07:29,399
Stop right there!

110
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,360
Ye!

111
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,240
No more training.

112
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,160
Come drink with me.

113
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:47,439
Your Highness.

114
00:07:48,839 --> 00:07:50,120
I have something to say.

115
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,680
Enough.

116
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:53,839
Drop the act.

117
00:07:56,439 --> 00:07:57,720
What do you mean, Your Highness?

118
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,360
I don't understand.

119
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:04,680
That hairpin wasn't heading for you
just now.

120
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:07,399
You deliberately stepped into its path.

121
00:08:09,279 --> 00:08:10,839
I was acting foolish.

122
00:08:11,519 --> 00:08:12,639
I know I was wrong.

123
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,240
Please punish me, Your Highness.

124
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,600
Then kneel here until sunset tomorrow

125
00:08:17,319 --> 00:08:18,600
and reflect on what you've done.

126
00:08:19,759 --> 00:08:22,000
If you still want to return
to my mansion,

127
00:08:22,839 --> 00:08:26,199
then put away those feelings
you shouldn't have.

128
00:08:27,879 --> 00:08:28,680
Understood.

129
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:30,959
Your Highness.

130
00:08:32,759 --> 00:08:34,919
Since you saw through my little trick,

131
00:08:35,639 --> 00:08:37,120
why did you still save me?

132
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:41,080
You still care about me, don't you?

133
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:44,519
The only one I've ever cared about
is Feng Weiyue.

134
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,279
You wanted to make her jealous.

135
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,440
I wanted to make her jealous too

136
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:52,080
and to stop her from being so cosy
with Yuan Qing.

137
00:08:53,279 --> 00:08:55,320
If you really want someone's care,

138
00:08:56,159 --> 00:08:58,759
why not look back at your old father?

139
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:12,320
There's no way I can't beat you!

140
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,360
Last round, come on.

141
00:09:14,039 --> 00:09:15,679
- Fifteen. Fifteen. Ten!
- Fifteen. Fifteen. Ten!

142
00:09:16,919 --> 00:09:17,720
Hey, I win!

143
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,879
I'm at twenty.

144
00:09:19,759 --> 00:09:20,519
Again.

145
00:09:20,799 --> 00:09:22,639
- Fifteen. Fifteen. Twenty!
- Fifteen. Twenty. Fifteen!

146
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,240
I'll drink.

147
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:29,360
Alas.

148
00:09:31,559 --> 00:09:32,519
Hey, again.

149
00:09:33,039 --> 00:09:33,960
Last round.

150
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,039
I don't want to play.

151
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:36,799
Why not?

152
00:09:38,399 --> 00:09:40,399
Ye, can't you see?

153
00:09:41,399 --> 00:09:45,279
Lu Ningyan's acting today...

154
00:09:46,639 --> 00:09:48,799
What do you mean by that?

155
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:50,279
What do I mean?

156
00:09:51,039 --> 00:09:53,720
That hairpin wasn't aimed at her.

157
00:09:54,159 --> 00:09:58,399
She threw herself into its path
so Mo Yuya would rescue her.

158
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,240
Wait.

159
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:01,519
Boss, saying that

160
00:10:01,519 --> 00:10:02,879
is a bit much.

161
00:10:03,799 --> 00:10:06,559
It happened suddenly.
Ningyan didn't have time to react.

162
00:10:06,639 --> 00:10:08,440
Isn't that understandable?

163
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:13,679
Humph.

164
00:10:13,919 --> 00:10:16,399
Twisting her ankles
three times in a row?

165
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:18,840
I've seen every palace drama ever made.

166
00:10:19,039 --> 00:10:20,639
Those shows weren't for nothing.

167
00:10:21,279 --> 00:10:24,720
That little trick only fools you men.

168
00:10:27,279 --> 00:10:28,320
Boss,

169
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:31,320
Ningyan is my daughter.

170
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:37,360
She served Prince of Rong for years.

171
00:10:38,039 --> 00:10:40,720
Isn't it natural she'd fall for him?

172
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:43,679
And she hasn't done anything improper,
has she?

173
00:10:43,879 --> 00:10:45,639
You're a young girl,

174
00:10:45,679 --> 00:10:47,679
and you slander another young girl
like that.

175
00:10:47,919 --> 00:10:48,399
I...

176
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:50,120
That makes me quite upset.

177
00:10:52,759 --> 00:10:53,519
Ye!

178
00:10:54,519 --> 00:10:56,200
Have you gotten too into character?

179
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,480
Do you really think she's your daughter?

180
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:58,759
As a matter of fact,

181
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:01,720
ever since these memories
surfaced in my mind,

182
00:11:01,919 --> 00:11:03,960
I can't tell if I'm the original Ye

183
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,399
or he's the current me.

184
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:07,159
But none of that matters.

185
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,600
You know I had no children
in modern times.

186
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:12,240
Now I have a daughter here
to keep me company.

187
00:11:12,559 --> 00:11:15,240
Isn't that fate?

188
00:11:15,279 --> 00:11:17,679
Oh, and boss,

189
00:11:18,039 --> 00:11:19,120
all these years,

190
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:22,440
I've always seen you as a daughter.

191
00:11:22,759 --> 00:11:23,919
Whenever you were in danger,

192
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:26,840
wasn't I the first to step up?

193
00:11:28,039 --> 00:11:29,279
Ye...

194
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:34,799
Boss,

195
00:11:36,039 --> 00:11:39,320
this is the last time
I'll call you boss, and I mean it.

196
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:41,399
But I'm telling you,

197
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:42,720
Ningyan

198
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:44,960
is the child I've claimed as my own.

199
00:11:45,879 --> 00:11:47,440
If you treat her like that again,

200
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:48,840
you and I...

201
00:11:50,639 --> 00:11:54,240
We're through. Through!

202
00:11:55,559 --> 00:11:56,679
Ye...

203
00:12:00,519 --> 00:12:02,559
I really am hard to like.

204
00:12:10,399 --> 00:12:12,919
It's cold at night.
You should've dressed warmer.

205
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:19,120
Shouldn't you be keeping your precious
Lu Ningyan company?

206
00:12:20,639 --> 00:12:22,240
She's not my precious.

207
00:12:23,039 --> 00:12:23,879
You are.

208
00:12:26,759 --> 00:12:29,399
Men always lie.

209
00:12:41,519 --> 00:12:42,679
I walked her back today

210
00:12:43,559 --> 00:12:45,159
to make you jealous on purpose.

211
00:12:46,799 --> 00:12:49,720
Because you're always hot and cold
with me

212
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:52,320
and so close to Yuan Qing.

213
00:12:53,160 --> 00:12:53,800
I...

214
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,200
Feng Weiyue,

215
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:57,960
do you think you're the only one
who gets jealous

216
00:12:58,600 --> 00:12:59,279
and hurt?

217
00:13:00,879 --> 00:13:04,360
Do you know I get jealous

218
00:13:04,919 --> 00:13:06,320
and hurt too?

219
00:13:15,159 --> 00:13:17,279
Lu Ningyan pulled those tricks today

220
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:18,559
because she has feelings for me.

221
00:13:19,639 --> 00:13:21,480
That's why she framed you.

222
00:13:22,559 --> 00:13:23,960
But I've already warned her.

223
00:13:24,559 --> 00:13:25,559
If it happens again,

224
00:13:26,600 --> 00:13:29,720
kneeling one night won't be the end
of it.

225
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:36,039
You knew she did it on purpose?

226
00:13:36,759 --> 00:13:38,080
I'm not blind.

227
00:13:44,759 --> 00:13:46,000
Mo Yuya...

228
00:13:47,879 --> 00:13:48,639
Thank you.

229
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:58,360
It feels good to be trusted.

230
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:10,919
Weiyue.

231
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:11,639
Hmm?

232
00:14:12,759 --> 00:14:17,120
Let's never doubt each other again,
all right?

233
00:14:21,279 --> 00:14:22,759
Never doubt each other?

234
00:14:25,679 --> 00:14:26,480
Alright.

235
00:14:34,919 --> 00:14:35,480
Oh, right.

236
00:14:37,159 --> 00:14:42,600
Lately, I keep seeing strange fragments

237
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:46,039
or having strange dreams.

238
00:14:46,799 --> 00:14:48,799
Dreams full of fighting and killing.

239
00:14:49,639 --> 00:14:51,720
Like I've become someone else.

240
00:14:55,639 --> 00:14:57,120
Who?

241
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,120
A killer.

242
00:15:00,559 --> 00:15:01,840
But...

243
00:15:02,799 --> 00:15:05,559
The moment I wake up,
I can't remember her name.

244
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:11,759
You must be training too hard
and are exhausted.

245
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:15,000
I'll find the mole in Xingyun Sect
as soon as I can,

246
00:15:15,879 --> 00:15:16,879
so that you won't

247
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:21,679
have such a hard time
contending for the Sect Master seat.

248
00:15:27,919 --> 00:15:31,919
She truly is the most perfect creation
you ever raised, Your Highness.

249
00:15:33,039 --> 00:15:35,320
Congratulations, Your Highness.
Your great cause is nearly complete.

250
00:15:35,919 --> 00:15:38,840
The yearning gu worm
has become a death trap at last.

251
00:15:40,039 --> 00:15:42,559
All that's missing is two drops
of a lover's tears of yearning.

252
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:48,639
It seems Feng Weiyue has made Mo Yuya
fall deeply in love with her.

253
00:15:49,799 --> 00:15:50,639
So next,

254
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:54,200
I will sound

255
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:57,120
the death knell for their love.

256
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:20,400
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

257
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:22,920
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

258
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:26,960
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

259
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:29,760
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

260
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:33,760
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

261
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:36,560
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

262
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:42,160
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

263
00:16:45,040 --> 00:16:47,440
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

264
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:50,760
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

265
00:16:51,920 --> 00:16:54,560
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

266
00:16:54,920 --> 00:16:57,120
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

267
00:16:58,360 --> 00:17:01,280
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

268
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:04,000
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

269
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:05,920
♪This love remains unchanged♪

270
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:09,440
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

271
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:13,600
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

272
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:17,720
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

273
00:17:18,080 --> 00:17:20,480
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

274
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:22,160
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

275
